#
# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is git-ignored and must never be committed.
# Most examples in this repository run with no key at all: 67 of the 180 REST
# operations sit at the Free plan floor and most of those answer with no
# credential. A few Free-floor data operations still ask for any valid key and
# answer 401 auth_required without one -- GET /api/v1/meta/access is the
# runtime answer for the credential you hold. Anonymous MCP callers see 67 tools.

# Needed only for capabilities above the Free plan floor.
# Get one at https://volstrata.com/api-keys
# Example shape (fake): VOLSTRATA_API_KEY=gex_key_v1_XXXXXXXX
VOLSTRATA_API_KEY=

# Canonical host. Leave as-is.
VOLSTRATA_API_BASE=https://api.volstrata.com
